          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "54d885daffbe4fd368287a2b10640d345b30f03c1d9a7dcda301ca5ddbe2a114",
          "excerpt": "九月戊寅，尊秦國夫人安氏為皇太妃，帝所生母也。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v09",
          "paragraphId": "new-v09-p5",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "34fbfe1acc826f9359668fe0181ffbe6eda2a14d23d33579d44eb8b2678154c7",
          "excerpt": "九月戊寅，尊秦國夫人安氏為皇太妃。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v283",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v283-p72",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "9dc9dda7f7feebf3a208890d9c91882bac3b2e0c0e89e08e4ae299738c9fae60",
          "excerpt": "九月，尊帝母秦國夫人安氏為皇太妃。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "本次受尊与开运三年命使册妃分开。"
      ]
    },
    {
